{
  "info": {
    "name": "Circa Integration API v1",
    "description": "## Circa × ZOOM — fase **solo pruebas**\n\n**Usar carpeta 02 · Pruebas.** No usar producción hasta aviso de Circa.\n\n| Campo | Valor |\n|-------|--------|\n| Base test | `{{baseUrlTest}}` |\n| client_id | `{{client_id}}` |\n| client_secret | (variable de colección) |\n| Bearer | `{{access_token_test}}` |\n\n### Pasos\n1. **00 · Auth → Obtener token — pruebas** (o usar Bearer ya cargado)\n2. Trabajar en **02 · Pruebas**\n3. Flujo: SVC-01 `situacion` → SVC-02 fotos → SVC-04 monto/plazo\n\n### `situacion`\n| Valor | Acción |\n|-------|--------|\n| `no_registrada` | SVC-02 |\n| `en_evaluacion` | Reconsultar |\n| `no_disponible` | Sin cupo |\n| `con_linea` | SVC-04 |\n\nGuía: `docs/integration/GUIA_ZOOM_PRUEBAS.md`  \nSwagger: https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1/docs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1" },
    { "key": "baseUrlTest", "value": "https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1/test" },
    { "key": "client_id", "value": "zoom-circa" },
    { "key": "client_secret", "value": "VDgiZdWPaEhqghHiyurUQZyQT2wqWYfSz5KTkyfLsWA" },
    { "key": "access_token_prod", "value": "" },
    { "key": "access_token_test", "value": "woeVXt0ZdO4Dx9m4OuwC2oFYzLMgQzdD" },
    { "key": "bodega_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "bodega_id_test", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pedido_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pedido_id_test", "value": "" },
    { "key": "q_dni_inexistente", "value": "00000000" },
    { "key": "q_dni_inactiva", "value": "PEGAR_DNI_INACTIVA" },
    { "key": "q_dni_activa_sin_cupo", "value": "PEGAR_DNI_ACTIVA_SIN_CUPO" },
    { "key": "q_dni_activa_con_cupo", "value": "PEGAR_DNI_ACTIVA_CON_CUPO" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Auth",
      "description": "ZOOM: usar **Obtener token — pruebas** (`data_mode=test`). Credenciales ya en variables de colección.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener token — producción",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('token prod', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.data_mode).to.eql('prod');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (j.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token_prod', j.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{client_secret}}\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"prod\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
            "description": "Intercambia client_id + client_secret por Bearer de **producción**.\n\n### Request ejemplo\n```json\n{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"zoom-circa\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"***\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"prod\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — token prod",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"<api_token_prod>\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"prod\",\n  \"expires_in\": null,\n  \"distribuidor_id\": \"d1a2b3c4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002\",\n  \"distribuidor\": \"ZOOM CORP\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener token — pruebas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('token test', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.data_mode).to.eql('test');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (j.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token_test', j.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{client_secret}}\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
            "description": "Igual que prod pero `data_mode: \"test\"` → token para `/api/v1/test/...`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — token test",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"<api_token_test>\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"test\",\n  \"expires_in\": null,\n  \"distribuidor_id\": \"d1a2b3c4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002\",\n  \"distribuidor\": \"ZOOM CORP\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Producción",
      "description": "⚠️ **No usar en la fase actual con ZOOM.** Datos reales. Reservado hasta habilitación Circa.\n\nAuth: `{{access_token_prod}}` (vacío a propósito).",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token_prod}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health (SVC-00)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('data_mode prod', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().data_mode).to.eql('prod'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Sin token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"circa-integration-api\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"prod\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Bodegas",
          "description": "SVC-01 consulta · SVC-02 precarga con fotos · SVC-03 patch",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "SVC-02 Precargar bodega (+ fotos)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "  var d = pm.response.json();",
                      "  if (d.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('bodega_id', d.id);",
                      "  pm.test('fotos y situacion', function () {",
                      "    pm.expect(d.tiene_foto_dueno).to.eql(true);",
                      "    pm.expect(d.tiene_foto_bodega).to.eql(true);",
                      "    pm.expect(d.situacion).to.eql('en_evaluacion');",
                      "  });",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    { "key": "telefono_whatsapp", "value": "987654321", "type": "text", "description": "Obligatorio" },
                    { "key": "dni_representante", "value": "42868000", "type": "text", "description": "DNI u RUC (al menos uno)" },
                    { "key": "razon_social", "value": "BODEGA DEMO SOCIO", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "nombre_comercial", "value": "Bodega Demo", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "direccion_fiscal", "value": "Av. Ejemplo 123", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "distrito", "value": "Comas", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "solo_dni_sin_ruc", "value": "true", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "foto_dueno", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "Obligatorio — seleccionar JPG/PNG del dueño" },
                    { "key": "foto_bodega", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "Obligatorio — seleccionar JPG/PNG de la fachada" }
                  ]
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas",
                "description": "## SVC-02 — Precargar / enviar a evaluación\n\n`Content-Type: multipart/form-data`\n\n**Obligatorios:** `telefono_whatsapp`, DNI o RUC, `foto_dueno`, `foto_bodega` (≤8 MB, JPEG/PNG/WebP).\n\nEn Postman: Body → form-data → en `foto_*` elegir archivo local.\n\nGuarda el `id` de la respuesta como `circa_bodega_id`."
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "200 — creada en_evaluacion",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "formdata",
                      "formdata": [
                        { "key": "telefono_whatsapp", "value": "987654321", "type": "text" },
                        { "key": "dni_representante", "value": "42868000", "type": "text" },
                        { "key": "razon_social", "value": "BODEGA DEMO SOCIO", "type": "text" },
                        { "key": "foto_dueno", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                        { "key": "foto_bodega", "type": "file", "src": [] }
                      ]
                    },
                    "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas"
                  },
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                  "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000099\",\n  \"external_id\": null,\n  \"telefono_whatsapp\": \"+51987654321\",\n  \"dni_representante\": \"42868000\",\n  \"ruc\": null,\n  \"razon_social\": \"BODEGA DEMO SOCIO\",\n  \"nombre_comercial\": \"Bodega Demo\",\n  \"estado\": \"inactivo\",\n  \"onboarding_fase\": \"precargada\",\n  \"kyc_nivel\": \"ninguno\",\n  \"linea_aprobada\": 200.0,\n  \"linea_disponible\": 0.0,\n  \"situacion\": \"en_evaluacion\",\n  \"tiene_foto_dueno\": true,\n  \"tiene_foto_bodega\": true,\n  \"es_test\": false,\n  \"created\": true\n}"
                },
                {
                  "name": "400 — falta foto",
                  "status": "Bad Request",
                  "code": 400,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                  "body": "{\n  \"detail\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"missing\",\n      \"loc\": [\"body\", \"foto_dueno\"],\n      \"msg\": \"Field required\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "SVC-01 Listar / buscar bodegas",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas?q=42868000&limit=20",
                "description": "## SVC-01 — Consultar afiliación y línea\n\nQuery `q` = DNI, RUC, teléfono o nombre.\n\n**Decidir con `items[i].situacion`** (por bodega). La `situacion` raíz es atajo del primer item."
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "200 — no_registrada",
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                  "body": "{\n  \"total\": 0,\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"situacion\": \"no_registrada\"\n}"
                },
                {
                  "name": "200 — en_evaluacion",
